---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description =
	'Privacy policy for ReferralNowReview.com. How this review site handles cookies, analytics, and the contact email contact@referralnowreview.com.';
const canonicalURL = new URL('/privacy-policy', Astro.site).href;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalURL={canonicalURL} hideCta>
	<article class="legal-page">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last updated October 23, 2026</p>
		<p>
			This policy describes how ReferralNowReview.com handles information when you visit this website.
			We do not run customer accounts, and we do not sell the software.
		</p>
		<h2>Who to contact</h2>
		<p>
			Email <a href="mailto:contact@referralnowreview.com">contact@referralnowreview.com</a> with privacy questions.
		</p>
		<h2>Information this site collects</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Messages you send to the contact address above, including your email and whatever you write.</li>
			<li>Basic technical data that a host normally logs, such as browser type, pages requested, and IP address.</li>
			<li>Nothing you type into a ReferralNow account. That product is run by the vendor, on the vendor’s site.</li>
		</ul>
		<h2>Cookies</h2>
		<p>
			This site itself does not require a login cookie. The host may set a cookie needed to deliver the
			page. If you click an affiliate link, JVZoo or the vendor may set their own cookies on their
			websites. Those cookies are covered by their policies, not this one.
		</p>
		<h2>Analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We may use a privacy-respecting analytics tool to see which pages are visited, in aggregate. That
			measurement is used to improve the site. It is not used to sell a profile of you. If an analytics
			tool sets a cookie, you can block cookies in your browser.
		</p>
		<h2>How we use information</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>To reply if you email us.</li>
			<li>To keep the site online and understand which guides are useful.</li>
			<li>To meet a legal request if one is valid.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We do not sell personal information.</p>
		<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
		<p>
			Emails are kept long enough to handle the request, then deleted when we no longer need them.
			Host logs follow the host’s retention period.
		</p>
		<h2>Children</h2>
		<p>This site is written for business owners. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page will change with it.</p>
		<p>
			Related: <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate disclosure</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms of service</a>
		</p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
